    "A bold shot of espresso poured over a sparkling pink sakura base and ice, topped with cherry blossoms — bright, floral and refreshingly light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シュワっと弾けるピンクの桜ベースと氷にエスプレッソを注ぎ、桜の花をのせた、華やかで軽やかな一杯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A comforting blend of ceremonial-grade matcha and ripe banana, finished with creamy milk for a naturally sweet, smooth, and nourishing latte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶と完熟バナナに、クリーミーなミルクを合わせた、自然な甘さでなめらかなほっとするラテ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A comforting blend of ceremonial-grade matcha and ripe banana.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶と完熟バナナの、ほっとする組み合わせ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dreamy fusion of earthy ceremonial-grade matcha and velvety ube, layered with creamy milk for a beautifully balanced sip that's nutty, subtly sweet, and irresistibly smooth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶となめらかなウベを、クリーミーなミルクと重ねた夢のような組み合わせ。香ばしく、ほんのり甘く、とてもなめらかな一杯です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dreamy fusion of earthy matcha and velvety ube, layered with creamy milk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抹茶となめらかなウベを、クリーミーなミルクと重ねて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stamp is added to your card with every order.": {
