    "Ceremonial matcha over sakura milk, crowned with sakura foam.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桜ミルクに抹茶を注ぎ、桜フォームをのせて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha blended with coconut water and topped with a velvety cloud for a smooth, tropical, and refreshing finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶をココナッツウォーターと合わせ、なめらかなクラウドをのせた、トロピカルで爽やかな一杯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha blended with fragrant Earl Grey tea and creamy milk for a smooth, aromatic latte with delicate bergamot notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶に香り高いアールグレイとクリーミーなミルクを合わせた、ベルガモットがほのかに香るラテ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha blended with fragrant Earl Grey tea.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶と香り高いアールグレイのブレンド。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha finished with a velvety cheese cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶に、なめらかなチーズクラウドをのせて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha layered with ripe strawberries and creamy milk for a refreshing latte with fruity sweetness and earthy depth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶に完熟いちごとクリーミーなミルクを重ねた、フルーティーな甘さと深みのある爽やかなラテ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha layered with ripe strawberries and creamy milk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶に完熟いちごとクリーミーなミルクを重ねて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha poured over creamy sakura milk and crowned with a soft pink sakura cream foam — a floral, gently sweet sip of spring in every glass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クリーミーな桜ミルクに最高級の抹茶を注ぎ、淡いピンクの桜クリームフォームをのせました。華やかでやさしい甘さの、春を感じる一杯です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ceremonial-grade matcha with silky milk — smooth and creamy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高級の抹茶となめらかなミルク。まろやかでクリーミー。"
