    "Made with ceremonial-grade matcha and finished with a velvety cheese cloud, this signature drink brings together earthy depth, creamy richness, and a subtle savory touch in every thoughtfully made cup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
