    "Roasted hojicha lattes\nwith creamy toppings": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "香ばしいほうじ茶ラテに\nクリーミーなトッピング"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roasted hojicha layered over creamy milk and sweet strawberry purée — toasty, fruity and smooth, like strawberries and cream with a roasted finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クリーミーなミルクと甘いいちごピューレに香ばしいほうじ茶を重ねた、いちごミルクのようなフルーティーでなめらかな一杯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roasted hojicha over cold milk under a vanilla sea salt cream foam, dusted with hojicha powder — the salt brings out the tea's toasty sweetness.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "冷たいミルクにほうじ茶を注ぎ、バニラシーソルトクリームフォームとほうじ茶パウダーをのせました。塩気がお茶の香ばしい甘さを引き立てます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roasted hojicha over milk and sweet strawberry purée.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ミルクと甘いいちごピューレに、香ばしいほうじ茶を重ねて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roasted hojicha poured over cold milk and topped with a spiced cookie butter cream foam and crushed biscuit — toasty, caramelly and smooth to the last sip.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "冷たいミルクに香ばしいほうじ茶を注ぎ、スパイスの効いたクッキーバタークリームフォームと砕いたビスケットをのせました。キャラメルのような香ばしさが最後まで続きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roasted hojicha poured over cold milk, crowned with a silky pistachio cream foam and chopped pistachios for a nutty, gently sweet finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "冷たいミルクに香ばしいほうじ茶を注ぎ、なめらかなピスタチオクリームフォームと刻んだピスタチオをのせた、ナッツの香るやさしい甘さの一杯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roasted hojicha under a sweet ube cream foam.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "甘いウベクリームフォームをのせた、香ばしいほうじ茶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
