    "Smooth ceremonial-grade matcha poured over ice and finished with fresh coconut — refreshing, and naturally vibrant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "なめらかな最高級の抹茶を氷に注ぎ、フレッシュなココナッツで仕上げた爽やかな一杯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smooth matcha poured over ice, finished with fresh coconut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "氷に注いだ抹茶を、フレッシュなココナッツで仕上げて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft matcha sponge rolled with fresh cream and topped with strawberry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "やわらかい抹茶スポンジで生クリームを巻き、いちごをのせて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorry, I didn't quite get that. I can help with orders, delivery, opening hours, stamps and payment — or connect you with a person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "申し訳ありません、うまく理解できませんでした。ご注文、配達、営業時間、スタンプ、お支払いについてお答えできます。スタッフにおつなぎすることもできます。"
          }
        }
