        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for the details! I'm checking on this now and will update you right here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "詳しく教えていただきありがとうございます！ただいま確認しておりますので、こちらでお知らせします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for your order — your matcha will be ready shortly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ご注文ありがとうございます。まもなく抹茶をご用意します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's one for our team. I'm connecting you with a person now — hang tight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "こちらはスタッフが対応いたします。ただいまおつなぎしますので、少々お待ちください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The matcha equivalent of an Americano — ceremonial-grade matcha whisked with hot water for a light, smooth, and authentic matcha experience.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抹茶版のアメリカーノ。最高級の抹茶をお湯で点てた、軽やかでなめらかな本格的な味わいです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The matcha equivalent of an Americano, whisked with hot water.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お湯で点てた、抹茶版のアメリカーノ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rich creaminess of banana pudding paired with vibrant ceremonial-grade matcha creates a dessert-inspired latte that's smooth, mellow, and irresistibly satisfying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "濃厚でクリーミーなバナナプディングと鮮やかな最高級の抹茶を合わせた、デザートのようにまろやかで満足感のあるラテ。"
