    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can edit or cancel within 2 minutes of placing it — before the barista starts preparing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ご注文から2分以内、バリスタが準備を始める前であれば、変更・キャンセルできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can follow any order under Profile › Order History — tap an order that's still on its way to see its receipt and live status.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロフィール › 注文履歴から、進行中の注文をタップすると、レシートと現在の状況を確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You earned a free matcha! Your 10th drink is on us.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無料の抹茶を獲得しました！10杯目は無料です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have a free drink — add one to your cart to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無料ドリンクがあります。ドリンクをカートに入れると使えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll need to sign in again to place orders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ご注文には再度サインインが必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all caught up": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しいお知らせはありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're welcome! Anything else I can help with?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どういたしまして！ほかにお手伝いできることはありますか？"
